The '''RGC-16 airspeeder''',<ref name="TVE" /> or simply called the '''RGC airspeeder''', was a model of [[airspeeder]]<ref name="DB" /> manufactured by the [[SoroSuub Corporation]] and used on planets like [[Coruscant]]. The [[RGC-18 landspeeder]] was a simpler [[landspeeder]] version of the airspeeder's design.<ref name="Head to Head" />

